# WGIS Windsurf Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` first. For DB work, use `data/DATA_AUTHORING_GUIDE.md` as the source of truth.

- Keep data work batch-based and source-record-first.
- Synchronize `data/records/**`, `data/entries.json`, `data/curation-batches.json`, and `data/PROJECT_STATE.md`.
- Run `node scripts/validate-data.js` before committing data changes.
